    "chunk_text": "r\u00e6dlice wregende. \u00dea oferhogode Herodes hine mid hys hyrede & bysmrode hine gescrydne hwitum reafe, & hyne And on \u00feam d\u00e6ge wurdun Herodes & Pilatus gefrynd; So\u00f0lice hig w\u00e6ron \u00e6r gefynd him betwynan. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Pilatus to \u00feara sacerda ealdrum & dugu\u00f0e ealdrum & to \u00feam folce, ge brohton me \u00feisne Ic hine sende agen to him & him naht \u00fe\u00e6slices dea\u00f0e gedon w\u00e6s. Ic hine gebetne forl\u00e6te. Niede he sceolde him forgyfan anne to hyra freolsd\u00e6ge. \u00dea hrymde eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00e6tg\u00e6dere & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nim \u00feisne & forgyf us Barrabban, se w\u00e6s for sumere Eft sp\u00e6c Pilatus to him & wolde forl\u00e6tan \u00fe\u00e6ne H\u00e6lend. \u00d0a hrymdon hig & cw\u00e6don, aho\u00f0 hine, aho\u00f0 hine. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he to him \u00feriddan si\u00f0e, hw\u00e6t dyde \u00fees yfeles? Ne mette ic nan \u00feing yfeles on \u00feissum men \u00fe\u00e6t he si dea\u00fees scyldig; Ic hine \u00fereage & forl\u00e6te. And hig astodon & mycelre stefne b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re ahangen, & hyra stefna swi\u00f0redon. & he forgef him \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00fee w\u00e6s for manslyhte & sumere sace on cwerterne, \u00feone hi b\u00e6don & \u00fe\u00e6ne And \u00fea hig hine l\u00e6ddon hi gefengon sumne Cyreniscne Simonem, se com of \u00fean tune & \u00fea rode him Him fylide mycel wered folces & wifa \u00fea hine heofun & weopun. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se H\u00e6l",
